{
  "id": "nagoya-2001-a7fa8dcaa0-q02",
  "school": "名古屋大学",
  "year": "2001",
  "subject": "多元数理科学研究科_全专攻",
  "text": "考虑从平面 $\\mathbb{R}^2$ 中除去原点 $O$ 和点 $A=(0,2)$ 得到的开集 $\\mathbb{R}^2\\setminus\\{O,A\\}$。在其上定义1次微分形式(1-形式) $\\alpha$：\n$$\\alpha=\\frac{-y\\,dx+x\\,dy}{x^2+y^2}.$$\n(1) 证明 $\\alpha$ 是闭形式（即其外微分 $d\\alpha$ 处处为零）。\n(2) 设 $C$ 为以原点 $O$ 为中心、半径为1的圆，取逆时针方向。求积分 $\\displaystyle\\int_C\\alpha$。\n(3) 在 $\\mathbb{R}^2\\setminus\\{O,A\\}$ 上定义1-形式 $\\omega=\\alpha+\\sqrt2\\,\\beta$，其中\n$$\\beta=\\frac{-(y-2)dx+x\\,dy}{x^2+(y-2)^2}.$$\n设 $\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2,\\Gamma_3$ 为图中所示带定向（均取逆时针）的 $C^1$ 级闭曲线，其中 $\\Gamma_1$ 只绕 $O$ 一圈（不绕 $A$），$\\Gamma_2$ 只绕 $A$ 一圈（不绕 $O$），$\\Gamma_3$ 同时绕 $O$ 与 $A$ 各一圈。求 $\\displaystyle\\int_{\\Gamma_1}\\omega,\\int_{\\Gamma_2}\\omega,\\int_{\\Gamma_3}\\omega$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "外微分",
    "闭形式与恰当形式",
    "环绕数(卷绕数)",
    "第二型曲线积分",
    "多连通区域上的积分",
    "叠加原理"
  ],
  "question_type": "闭形式的围道积分与卷绕数",
  "method": [
    "直接计算偏导数验证闭形式",
    "参数化圆周计算线积分",
    "利用角形式的卷绕数公式",
    "线性叠加分解ω=α+√2β"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "写出α的分量P,Q，计算∂Q/∂x与∂P/∂y并证明相等",
    "参数化单位圆代入α，化简得dθ并积分",
    "说明β是以A为中心的同类角形式，其围道积分等于2π乘以关于A的卷绕数",
    "利用线性性对每条曲线分别代入O、A的卷绕数计算ω的积分"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "closed_form_line_integral_winding_number",
    "template": "α=(-y dx+x dy)/(x²+y²), β为以A为中心的同类形式，ω=α+√2β，求∮ω关于不同卷绕情形的值",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 4,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1)",
      "steps": [
        "记$\\alpha=P\\,dx+Q\\,dy$，其中$P=\\frac{-y}{x^2+y^2}$，$Q=\\frac{x}{x^2+y^2}$",
        "计算$\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}=\\frac{(x^2+y^2)-x\\cdot2x}{(x^2+y^2)^2}=\\frac{y^2-x^2}{(x^2+y^2)^2}$，计算$\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}=\\frac{-(x^2+y^2)+y\\cdot2y}{(x^2+y^2)^2}=\\frac{y^2-x^2}{(x^2+y^2)^2}$",
        "两者相等，故$d\\alpha=\\left(\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x}-\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}\\right)dx\\wedge dy=0$，即$\\alpha$为闭形式"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2)",
      "steps": [
        "参数化$C$：$x=\\cos\\theta,\\ y=\\sin\\theta$，$\\theta:0\\to2\\pi$，则$dx=-\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta$，$dy=\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta$",
        "代入分子：$-y\\,dx+x\\,dy=\\sin^2\\theta\\,d\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta=d\\theta$，分母$x^2+y^2=1$，故$\\alpha=d\\theta$",
        "积分$\\int_C\\alpha=\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta=2\\pi$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(3)",
      "steps": [
        "β是以A为中心的同类角形式，与α结构完全类似，因此对任意绕A一圈（逆时针）的闭曲线，$\\oint\\beta=2\\pi$；不绕A的曲线则$\\oint\\beta=0$。同理α对绕O与否给出$2\\pi$或$0$",
        "对$\\Gamma_1$（只绕O）：$\\int_{\\Gamma_1}\\omega=\\int_{\\Gamma_1}\\alpha+\\sqrt2\\int_{\\Gamma_1}\\beta=2\\pi+\\sqrt2\\cdot0=2\\pi$",
        "对$\\Gamma_2$（只绕A）：$\\int_{\\Gamma_2}\\omega=0+\\sqrt2\\cdot2\\pi=2\\sqrt2\\,\\pi$",
        "对$\\Gamma_3$（同时绕O与A各一圈）：$\\int_{\\Gamma_3}\\omega=2\\pi+\\sqrt2\\cdot2\\pi=2\\pi(1+\\sqrt2)$"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "证明1-形式 $\\eta=2xy\\,dx+x^2\\,dy$ 在 $\\mathbb{R}^2$ 上是恰当形式，并求其原函数。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "恰当形式",
        "原函数求解"
      ],
      "question_type": "恰当形式判定",
      "method": [
        "偏导数相等判定",
        "逐步积分求原函数"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "验证∂Q/∂x=∂P/∂y",
        "对x积分得F含待定函数g(y)",
        "对y求偏导确定g(y)"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "exact_form_potential",
        "template": "验证$\\eta=P\\,dx+Q\\,dy$恰当并求原函数",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$P=2xy,Q=x^2$，$\\partial Q/\\partial x=2x=\\partial P/\\partial y$，故η恰当",
            "对x积分$\\int 2xy\\,dx=x^2y+g(y)$",
            "对y求导得$x^2+g'(y)=x^2\\Rightarrow g'(y)=0$，故原函数为$F(x,y)=x^2y+C$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-a7fa8dcaa0-q02-practice-01",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "证明1-形式 $\\mu=\\dfrac{x\\,dx+y\\,dy}{x^2+y^2}$ 在 $\\mathbb{R}^2\\setminus\\{O\\}$ 上是闭形式，并计算 $\\oint_C\\mu$（$C$为单位圆逆时针方向）。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "闭形式",
        "径向形式",
        "围道积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "闭形式积分",
      "method": [
        "直接验证闭性",
        "利用恒定模长简化积分"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "验证∂Q/∂x=∂P/∂y",
        "指出μ实为d(½ln(x²+y²))",
        "沿单位圆x²+y²=1恒定，得积分为0"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "radial_closed_form_integral",
        "template": "验证并计算$\\oint_C \\dfrac{x\\,dx+y\\,dy}{x^2+y^2}$",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$P=x/(x^2+y^2),Q=y/(x^2+y^2)$，计算偏导数相等，μ为闭形式",
            "注意到μ=d(½ln(x²+y²))，为恰当形式",
            "在单位圆上x²+y²≡1为常数，故x dx+y dy=½d(x²+y²)=0，积分为0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-a7fa8dcaa0-q02-practice-02",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "对半径为2、中心在原点的圆 $C_2$（逆时针），重新计算 $\\int_{C_2}\\alpha$，其中α与原题相同，并说明其与半径无关的原因。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "卷绕数",
        "参数化积分"
      ],
      "question_type": "围道积分",
      "method": [
        "参数化圆周",
        "化简为dθ形式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "设x=2cosθ,y=2sinθ",
        "代入α化简",
        "积分并说明结果与半径无关"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "radius_invariance_winding",
        "template": "计算半径r圆上$\\oint\\alpha$并验证与r无关",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 5,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "设$x=2\\cos\\theta,y=2\\sin\\theta$，则$-y\\,dx+x\\,dy=4\\sin^2\\theta\\,d\\theta+4\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta=4\\,d\\theta$，且$x^2+y^2=4$",
            "代入得$\\alpha=d\\theta$，与半径无关",
            "积分$\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta=2\\pi$，与单位圆情形相同"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-a7fa8dcaa0-q02-practice-03",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "设 $C_3$ 为以 $(3,0)$ 为中心、半径 $1/2$ 的圆（逆时针），不围绕原点O。求 $\\int_{C_3}\\alpha$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "闭形式在单连通区域积分为零",
        "格林公式"
      ],
      "question_type": "不含奇点区域上的闭形式积分",
      "method": [
        "格林公式",
        "闭形式性质"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "确认圆盘不含O",
        "α在此圆盘内处处光滑且闭",
        "由格林公式得积分为0"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "nonenclosing_closed_form_integral",
        "template": "计算不绕O的闭曲线上闭形式α的积分",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 4,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "圆$C_3$所围圆盘为$\\{(x,y):(x-3)^2+y^2\\le1/4\\}$，不含原点O",
            "α在该圆盘内处处光滑且dα=0（由(1)的结论）",
            "由格林公式，$\\int_{C_3}\\alpha=\\iint_{\\text{圆盘}}d\\alpha=0$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-a7fa8dcaa0-q02-practice-04",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "设闭曲线 $\\Gamma$ 绕原点O与点A=(0,2)各两圈（均逆时针），求 $\\int_\\Gamma\\omega$，其中ω与原题定义相同。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "卷绕数的推广",
        "线性叠加"
      ],
      "question_type": "多重卷绕的围道积分",
      "method": [
        "卷绕数为2时的比例放大",
        "线性叠加"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "确定关于O和A的卷绕数均为2",
        "分别计算α和β的积分为2×2π",
        "叠加求ω积分"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "double_winding_number_integral",
        "template": "卷绕数为2时计算$\\int_\\Gamma(\\alpha+\\sqrt2\\beta)$",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "由卷绕数公式，$\\oint\\alpha=2\\pi\\times(\\text{绕O圈数})=2\\pi\\times2=4\\pi$",
            "同理$\\oint\\beta=2\\pi\\times2=4\\pi$",
            "故$\\int_\\Gamma\\omega=4\\pi+\\sqrt2\\times4\\pi=4\\pi(1+\\sqrt2)$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-a7fa8dcaa0-q02-practice-05",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    }
  ],
